 "summary": "Stop jumping with armor on in GTA 6. Hold L1 for the wheel and switch to the Items tab; select the vest and a blue bar shows above your health. But armor and the parachute share the same slot, so only one can be on at a time. Before you leap off a roof or a chopper, press R2 on that slot to swap to the chute. Then jump.",
